<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian industry output up 4.9% yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian industry output up 4.9% yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Statistics Office  released the following indices for production in industry excluding  the construction sector -</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	    May 97     April 97	 May 96</p>
<p> work day index (1990=100) (*)  111.6	 105.1	    106.4</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) index per working day, adjusted for length and composition  of the months  </p>
<p> SEASONALLY ADJUSTED INDICES(*) May 97     April 97	 May 96</p>
<p> industry as a whole		101.7	 101.5	     98.2</p>
<p> construction industry	     92.5	  93.2	     89.2</p>
<p> investment goods		   104.3	 103.7	     99.7</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) seasonally adjusted based on averages of the last 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
